<section id="journey" aria-labelledby="jh">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Where to begin</span>
      <h2 id="jh">Where are you in your Medicare journey?</h2>
      <p>Pick what sounds like you. Each path points to the parts of this guide that matter most.</p></div>
    <div class="journey">
      <a class="jcard" href="#enroll"><span class="jico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></span>
